%% pir-cloud 微波分支 — 时序图
%% 包含：设备配网激活、上报告警(差异化文案)、固件OTA、面板绑定设备(带类型)

%% ==================== 1. 设备配网激活流程（微波设备） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device as ESP32-S3 设备
    participant AP as AP Portal (WebServer)
    participant Storage as Storage (NVS)
    participant Server as 后端 API

    Note over Device,Server: 阶段一：AP 配网
    Device->>Device: 上电 setup()
    Device->>Storage: begin() 读取 NVS
    Storage-->>Device: 无 WiFi 凭据
    Device->>Device: WifiManager.enterApConfig()
    Device->>AP: 创建热点 PirCloud-MW-Setup-XXXX
    Note over AP: DNSServer Captive Portal

    User->>AP: 连接热点 → 访问 192.168.4.1
    AP-->>User: 返回配网页面 HTML
    User->>AP: POST /set {ssid, pass, code}
    AP->>Storage: updateActivationCode(code)
    AP->>Storage: updateWifi(ssid, pass)
    AP-->>User: "已收到，设备即将重启"
    AP->>Device: s_apExitSignal = true
    Device->>Device: exitApConfig() → 重启 → WiFi.begin(ssid, pass)

    Note over Device,Server: 阶段二：激活换 Token
    Device->>Device: WiFi 已连接，检查 NVS 无 device_token
    Device->>Server: POST /api/device/activate (X-Activation-Code: WB-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX)
    Server->>Server: 查 ActivationCode (status=bound, device_type=microwave)
    Server->>Server: 查关联 Device → 取 device_token
    Server-->>Device: 200 {deviceToken, deviceId, deviceName, deviceType:"microwave"}
    Device->>Storage: saveDeviceToken(token) 写入 NVS
    Device->>Device: 激活完成，进入正常上报循环

%% ==================== 2. 上报告警流程（按类型差异化文案） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as MicrowaveSensor
    participant Reporter as Reporter
    participant Server as 后端 /api/report
    participant ReportSvc as ReportService
    participant DB as MySQL (Prisma)
    participant NotiSvc as NotificationService
    participant Email as EmailService
    participant QQ as OneBotService

    Sensor->>Sensor: tick() 检测 ABSENCE→PRESENCE 边沿
    Sensor->>Sensor: 本地防抖通过 (30s 窗口)
    Sensor-->>Reporter: 触发上报请求
    Reporter->>Server: POST /api/report (X-Device-Token, {status:"presence", timestamp, rssi})
    Server->>ReportSvc: handleReport(deviceToken, data)
    ReportSvc->>DB: validateDevice — 查 Device (select device_type)
    DB-->>ReportSvc: {id, user_id, name, device_type:"microwave"}
    ReportSvc->>DB: Device.update (last_report_at, status=online)
    ReportSvc->>DB: DeviceConfig.findUnique (防抖间隔)
    DB-->>ReportSvc: debounce_interval=30
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: DebounceService.shouldTrigger → true
    ReportSvc->>DB: Event.create {type:"alarm", detail:{message:"微波人体检测告警", report_data:{...}}}
    Note over ReportSvc: message 按 device_type 动态：<br/>microwave → "微波人体检测告警"<br/>infrared → "红外人体检测告警"
    ReportSvc->>NotiSvc: dispatch({id, name, user_id, device_type:"microwave"}, event)
    Note over NotiSvc: 异步 setImmediate

    NotiSvc->>DB: DeviceConfig.findUnique (notify_channels)
    DB-->>NotiSvc: channels=["email","qq_bot"]
    NotiSvc->>DB: User.findUnique (email, qq_number, membership)
    DB-->>NotiSvc: {email, qq_number, isPremium=true}

    Note over NotiSvc,Email: 邮件渠道
    NotiSvc->>NotiSvc: alarmType = "微波人体检测告警" (按 device_type)
    NotiSvc->>Email: sendAlarmEmail(email, deviceName, time, "微波人体检测告警")
    Email-->>NotiSvc: {success: true}

    Note over NotiSvc,QQ: QQ 渠道
    NotiSvc->>NotiSvc: tag = "[微波·有人]" (按 device_type 加前缀)
    NotiSvc->>QQ: sendMessage(qqNumber, "[微波·有人]\n设备:xxx\n时间:xxx\nWiFi强度:xx%")
    QQ-->>NotiSvc: true

    NotiSvc-->>ReportSvc: dispatch 完成
    Server-->>Reporter: 200 {message:"上报成功"}

%% ==================== 3. 固件 OTA 流程 ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device as ESP32-S3 设备
    participant OtaMgr as OtaManager
    participant Storage as Storage (NVS)
    participant Server as 后端 /api/firmware
    participant Alist as Alist 存储

    Note over Device: loop 中周期性检查 (每小时)
    Device->>OtaMgr: tick()
    OtaMgr->>Storage: getFwVersion()
    Storage-->>OtaMgr: "1.0.0" (当前版本)
    OtaMgr->>Server: GET /api/firmware/latest?deviceType=microwave
    Server->>Server: getLatest("microwave")
    Server-->>OtaMgr: 200 {version:"1.1.0", downloadUrl:"/api/firmware/download/latest?deviceType=microwave", checksum:"sha256..."}
    OtaMgr->>OtaMgr: 版本比对 1.1.0 > 1.0.0 → 有新版
    OtaMgr->>Device: LED 指示 OTA 进行中

    OtaMgr->>Server: GET /api/firmware/download/latest?deviceType=microwave
    Server->>Alist: 302 重定向到 Alist 下载地址
    Alist-->>OtaMgr: 固件 bin 文件流
    OtaMgr->>OtaMgr: Update.begin(fileSize)
    loop 分块写入
        OtaMgr->>OtaMgr: Update.write(chunk)
    end
    OtaMgr->>OtaMgr: Update.end() → 校验通过
    OtaMgr->>Storage: setFwVersion("1.1.0")
    OtaMgr->>Device: ESP.restart() → 重启到新固件
    Note over Device: 新固件启动，版本号 1.1.0

%% ==================== 4. 面板绑定设备流程（带类型） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户(浏览器)
    participant Frontend as 前端 React
    participant Server as 后端 /api/devices/bind
    participant DeviceSvc as DeviceService
    participant DB as MySQL (Prisma)

    User->>Frontend: 输入激活码 WB-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX
    User->>Frontend: 点击"绑定"
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/devices/bind {activationCode}
    Server->>DeviceSvc: bindDevice(userId, activationCode)
    DeviceSvc->>DB: ActivationCode.findUnique (含 device_type)
    DB-->>DeviceSvc: {id, code, status:"unused", device_type:"microwave"}
    DeviceSvc->>DeviceSvc: 校验 status=unused ✓
    DeviceSvc->>DeviceSvc: generateDeviceToken()
    DeviceSvc->>DB: $transaction { Device.create(device_type="microwave"),<br/>DeviceConfig.create,<br/>ActivationCode.update(status="bound") }
    DB-->>DeviceSvc: newDevice {id, name, device_token, device_type:"microwave"}
    DeviceSvc-->>Server: {id, name, deviceToken, status, deviceType:"microwave", createdAt}
    Server-->>Frontend: 200 {code:0, data:{device:{...,deviceType:"microwave"}}}
    Frontend->>Frontend: 绑定成功，显示设备类型 Chip
    Note over Frontend: DEVICE_TYPE_MAP["microwave"] → {label:"微波", icon:Radar}
    Frontend-->>User: 显示 "设备类型: 微波" + Radar 图标 Chip
